  "prefLabel": "Plc 302.02 Authorized signer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 302.02 “Authorized signer” means the individual who has been duly authorized by an entity to sign applications and related documents that are submitted to the OPLC.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 300) #13606, eff 5-1-23; ss by #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300); ss by #14137, eff 12-1-24 (formerly Plc 302.04)",
